<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the second test between Zimbabwe and England at Harare Sports</p>
<p>Club on Sunday:</p>
<p>England first innings 156 (G.Whittall 4-18; H.Streak 4-43)</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 215 (G.Flower 73; D.Gough 4-40)</p>
<p>England second innings (overnight 17-1)</p>
<p> N.Knight c Campbell b Strang	    30</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Campbell b Streak	   1</p>
<p> A.Stewart not out			  101</p>
<p> N.Hussain c Houghton b Strang	    6</p>
<p> G.Thorpe not out			    50</p>
<p> Extras (lb-5 nb-1 w-1)		     7</p>
<p> Total (for three wickets)		195</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-7 2-75 3-89</p>
<p>Bowling: Streak 18-5-47-1, Brandes 21-6-45-0 (w1), Olonga</p>
<p>7-0-31-0 (nb1), Whittall 14-6-16-0, Strang 26-6-42-2, G.Flower</p>
<p>7-2-9-0</p>
</text>
